tps://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFR3A89CJMM96C6G471XEZV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  きもちの、環境の、人、天気\n  \n  雨　くもり　晴れ　雪　\n  \n  人間の生き方や気持ちって\n  天気以上に複雑だなって思う\n  \n  毎日の変わりゆく天気に\n  驚いていられないなあ\n  \n  \n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFR3B9Z5B39SGGYAQKSA7J7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  ハワイくらいに安定した天気もいいなって思うけど\n  日本の、四季があって梅雨があって\n  頻繁に変わる天気も不安定で魅力的でわたしは好き\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  雨が降る日もあるし\n  泣きたい日だってある\n  でもいつかは必ず晴れます\n  \n  \n  今日も素敵な1日になりますように！\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-19501":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは\n鈴木絢音です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/07/22/3849049/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は研究生全員で\n収録をしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影場所は遊園地.·˖*✩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/07/22/3849049/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん泣きました(><)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オンエアお楽しみに！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/07/22/3849049/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n幕張個別握手会でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足を運んで下さった皆さん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/i